From 215f28846ce2042051e4d7ae3d4b787b8ac63132 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ren=C3=A9=20Dudfield?= <renedudfield@microsoft.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 23:59:07 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] app: build-manifest: Support product company metadata

Products built from Headlamp currently inherit Headlamp's author and Linux
package metadata even when the product manifest replaces the application
identity. This can leave downstream packages attributed to the wrong company.

Map a product company name to Electron Builder author metadata and Linux
vendor, and allow products to configure a separate Linux maintainer contact.
